<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95522" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σμινθεύς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έως</span>,
			ὁ, epith. of Apollo, <i><span class="en">
			Il.
			1.39
		</span></i>; either (from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σμίνθος</span> or
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σμίνθη</span> a town in the Troad, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>, St. Byz.) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the
				Sminthian</i>; or (from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμίνθος</span>) <i>mouse-killer</i>, Sch. ad loc., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				13.1.48
			</span></i> and <i><span class="en">
				64
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σμίνθιος</span></b> , ὁ, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				12.5
			</span></i>, Sch.Il.l.c.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σμίνθιος, ὁ</span>
			(sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήν</span>), name of a month at
			Rhodes, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1131
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				12(1).1068.2
			</span></i>, al.; written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζμ-</span>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				1149.8
			</span></i>, al.: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σμίνθεια</span></b> ,
				τά, <i>games at festival of Apollo</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σμινθεύς, Μους. Σμυρν</span>. <i><span class="en">
				1876p.125
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Troad</span>).</div>
